From @ntnguyen1234 suggestion, This flag triggers a clean, ad-free layout that eliminates wasted ad-rail space in the aside area.

On episode pages (`/anime/.../episodio-N`):

```js
var match = /(?:^|;\s*)ag_af=([^;]*)/.exec(document.cookie || '');
adFree = raw.split('.').map(...).indexOf('anime') !== -1;
if (!adFree) return;
rails.classList.add('player-adfree');
host.classList.remove('hidden');
// moves episode selector next to player instead of below
```

